Write the human-authored task prompt here, in two stages — Research & Plan,
then Experiment & Implementation — ending with the deliverables list
(canonical example: tasks/multiplexing-ion-chain-qnet/task.md).

Describe the physical system, assumptions, units, desired output, absolute
input/output paths, and any immutable snapshot date. Do not mention skill names
or tell the agent which skill to use. Deliverables are only paper-submission or
presentable artifacts (paper.pdf, report.pptx, result data) — never process
files like PLAN.md.
